    <node id="&quot;CORRUPTION WATCH (SOUTH AFRICA)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Corruption Watch (South Africa) is a non-governmental organization based in South Africa that monitors corruption involving public and charitable resources. It was launched in January 2012 by COSATU."</data>
